<<Walter Neutral>>
<<Walter Look F>>

<<Switch_Camera CamController Char2Cam>>
Cole: (Looks you over for a beat, then gives a small nod.)

-> Good evening
    Player: Good evening, officer. Hope the day's been kind to you.
    Cole: ...Kind is a strong word. But thanks.
-> Introduce yourself
    Player: New face, I know. Nice to finally put a name to the badge.
    Cole: You settling in alright?
-> Joke
    Player: Relax, officer. I haven't broken any laws yet.
    Cole: (A faint smirk.) Yet.
-> Formal greeting
    Player: Good evening. What can I get started for you?
    Cole: Straight to business. I can respect that.

<<Switch_Camera CamController Char23Cam>>
<<Eliana Look L>>
Eliana: Don't mind him. He does that with everyone new.
<<Cole Look R>>
